    "title": "<p><strong>Table&nbsp;3.01</strong> Histological features of keratoacanthoma and keratoacanthoma-like cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma (cSCC-KAL)</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "WHO Classification of Tumours Editorial Board. Skin tumours. Lyon (France): International Agency for Research on Cancer; 2025. (WHO classification of tumours series, 5th ed.; vol. 12). https://publications.iarc.who.int/650.",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 769px; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Feature</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Keratoacanthoma</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">cSCC-KAL</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Symmetry</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Yes</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Variable</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Exoendophytic</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Yes</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Variable</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Even, bowl-shaped base</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Yes</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Variable</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Keratotic crater</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Well formed in mature stage</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Variable</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Overhanging lips of epidermis</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Well formed in mature stage</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Variable</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Width-to-thickness ratio</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Typically 2&ndash;3:1</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Variable, may be &lt;&nbsp;2:1 (verticality)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Borders of invasion in proliferative phase</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Usually infiltrative at the periphery, can be mainly circumscribed</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Variable, but often circumscribed and pushing</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Depth relative to sweat gland coils</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Usually at the same level; below uncommon</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Variable; may be high, at the same level, or below</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Predominant parakeratosis with hyperchromatic and crowded nuclei</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Minimal</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Often present, but variable</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Infundibular keratinization: laminated with keratohyalin granules</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Predominates superficially and centrally</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Usually less orderly</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Trichilemmal keratinization: compact with deficient keratohyalin granules</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Predominates deeply and peripherally</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Usually less orderly</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">N:C&nbsp;ratio in peripheral cells</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Typically 1:1 and preserved in cells with large nuclei or multinucleation</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Variable, often reduced</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Mitotic activity beyond peripheral 1&ndash;3&nbsp;cells</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Minimal</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Usually present</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Nuclear pleomorphism beyond peripheral 1&ndash;3&nbsp;cells</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Minimal</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Usually present, may be focal</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Spontaneous acantholysis (not associated with neutrophils)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Absent</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Frequent, may be focal</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Intraepithelial &ldquo;follicular&rdquo; mucin</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Absent</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Frequent, may be focal</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Necrosis</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Absent</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Uncommon</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Perineural invasion</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Uncommon (&lt;&nbsp;1%)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Uncommon</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Venous invasion</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Rare</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Rare</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Elastic and collagen entrapment (H&amp;E or elastic stains)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Common, often widespread, occasionally absent</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Variable, often absent</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Band-like, lichenoid tissue reaction, lymphocytes predominant, variable eosinophils and neutrophils</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Often prominent in mature stage but lacking in early proliferative lesions</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Variable, can be prominent</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Plasma cells</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Minimal</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Variable, may be prominent</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Regression: loss of proliferative zone (squamatization), numerous Civatte and colloid bodies, peripheral fibrosis, keratin granulomas</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Established regression supports diagnosis</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Variable but usually lacking</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Desmoplastic stroma</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Peripheral to lesion in late regressing stage</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.031px; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Variable but often lacking</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 241.844px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Severe solar elastosis</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242px; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"3